{"kind": "mod", "id": 1509, "name": "SiulSC Guns - Realism Compatibility Patch", "slug": "siulsc-guns-realism-compatibility-patch", "teaser": "This adds SPT Realism compatibility for the weapon mods by SiulSC.", "owner_name": "Therkelsen", "downloads": 2489, "favourites": 0, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": null, "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": null, "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-13T18:04:50.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-06-27T08:40:35.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-06-27T08:40:35.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.9.0", "latest_version": "1.0.4", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": null, "description_html": "<p><strong>Contents</strong></p>\n<p>Compatibility patches for the weapon mods by <strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/28953-siulsc/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SiulSC</a></strong>.</p>\n<p>If you experience any issues, feel free to open an issue. If fixing it yourself is more your thing, there’s a guide on how to contribute on the GitHub repository.</p>\n<p><strong>Dependencies</strong></p>\n<p>Obviously, you’ll need the <strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1704-ar-54-7-62x54mmr-designated-marksman-rifle-dmr/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">AR-54</a>, <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1699-dvl-50-50-cal-single-shot-bolt-action-sniper-rifle/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">DVL-50</a></strong>, and/or <strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1696-mk-12-ar-10-shotgun/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">MK-12</a></strong> and <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/606-spt-realism-mod/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>SPT Realism</strong></a> for this to do anything.</p>\n<p><strong>Installation</strong></p>\n<p>1. Remove the Realism incompatibility line from the mods, “\\user\\mods\\&lt;mod_folder&gt;\\package.json”, then save:</p>\n<p>“incompatibilities”: [ “SPT-Realism” ], 2. Download the latest release.</p>\n<p>3. Drop the provided user folder into your SPT folder.</p>\n<p>If the changes don’t load, you may want to also clear cache / temp files.</p>\n<p>1. In \\user\\cache, delete:</p>\n<p>bundleHashCache.json, jsonCache.json, and modCache.json</p>\n<p>But do NOT delete the folder named bundles.</p>\n<p>2. In the SPT launcher, clear temp files:</p>\n<p>Open launcher &gt; Click settings &gt; Click clean temp files</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "3.8.3", "content_length": null, "downloads": 387, "published_at": "2024-06-27T08:40:35.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1509/siulsc-guns-realism-compatibility-patch/1.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.1", "spt_version_constraint": "3.8.3", "content_length": null, "downloads": 367, "published_at": "2024-06-29T01:50:53.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1509/siulsc-guns-realism-compatibility-patch/1.0.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.2", "spt_version_constraint": "3.8.3", "content_length": null, "downloads": 314, "published_at": "2024-07-03T17:11:34.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1509/siulsc-guns-realism-compatibility-patch/1.0.2", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.3", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.9.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 617, "published_at": "2024-08-21T13:41:06.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/150